ttery holds through the night now."},{"day":28,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":28,"min":430,"text":"A winter night in the van. You sleep in everything you own, and it isn’t enough."},{"day":28,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":28,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":28,"min":469,"text":"Fresh rubber. For a day they'll feel like someone else's."},{"day":28,"min":844,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$76."},{"day":28,"min":844,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":28,"min":972,"text":"2 parts worth keeping from the free pile. 2 in the van."},{"day":28,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":29,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":29,"min":430,"text":"A winter night in the van. You sleep in everything you own, and it isn’t enough."},{"day":29,"min":430,"text":"Registration and insurance: $70. The week's bills don't care about your card."},{"day":29,"min":430,"text":"You take Something Real, for $36. Send 2 lines outside at V3 or harder. It counts from now."},{"day":29,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":29,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":29,"min":467,"text":"The kid at the desk stamps your hand."},{"day":29,"min":475,"text":"Onsight: Drop-Knee, V1, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":483,"text":"Onsight: Pocket Rocket, V0, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":491,"text":"Onsight: The Arête, V2, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":499,"text":"Onsight: Sidepull City, V3, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":499,"text":"Something clicks. You're climbing V5 now."},{"day":29,"min":507,"text":"Onsight: Compression, V4, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":515,"text":"Board grades: that's no V4. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":29,"min":515,"text":"Onsight: Micro Crimps, V4, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":523,"text":"Board grades: that's no V5. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":29,"min":523,"text":"Onsight: The Long Move, V5, on go 1."},{"day":29,"min":531,"text":"Onsight: Volume Stack, V5, on