ou wake up feeling human again."},{"day":31,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":31,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":31,"min":648,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$38."},{"day":31,"min":648,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":31,"min":776,"text":"2 parts worth keeping from the free pile. 4 in the van."},{"day":31,"min":866,"text":"Door seals, foam in the gaps. The wind finds less of the van."},{"day":31,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":31,"min":1020,"text":"A long pause, then a genuinely mortified apology through the glass, and the sound of two people helping each other away down the road."},{"day":32,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":32,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":32,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":32,"min":638,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$38."},{"day":32,"min":638,"text":"Gas, $12. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":32,"min":743,"text":"Scenic Overlook. A pull-off with a hundred-mile view. Worth every minute of the detour."},{"day":32,"min":863,"text":"You and Sage top out the testpiece together. Partners for good. +6 technique."},{"day":32,"min":883,"text":"Sage climbs Warm Boulder. At the long reach: drop-knee. New beta: drop-knee and reach."},{"day":32,"min":893,"text":"You and Hazel are regulars."},{"day":32,"min":893,"text":"Repeat: Warm Boulder, V2, on go 3."},{"day":32,"min":893,"text":"The crew has a name: Send City Lifers. Nobody will admit how long it took."},{"day":32,"min":928,"text":"A queue for it. You wait 10 minutes for your turn."},{"day":32,"min":928,"text":"Sun's on this line now. Everything feels greasy."},{"day":32,"min":928,"text":"Onsight: Local Testpiece, 5.12b, on go 1."},{"day":32,"min":928,"text":"Hazel lowers you off and says, \"Well, that’s that, then,\" which is high praise."},{"day":32,"min":938,"text":"Onsight: Highball Arête, V5, on go 1."},{"day":32,"min":938,"text":"Something Real, done. $36 off the board."},{"day":32,"min":948,"text":"Onsight: The Project, V6, on go 1."},{"day":32,"min":948,"text":"Somebody at the fire mentions a line. Not by name. Just a direction and a grade, and a look to see what you do with it. +1 head."},{"day":32,"min":958,"text":"Onsight: The open project, V7, on go 1."},{"day":32,"min":958,"text":"Gas, $12. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":32,"min":1038,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":33,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":33,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":33,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":33,"min":649,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$38."},{"day":33,"min":649,"text":"A walk-in: paid, and that’s all. Signed-up shifts are the ones that count toward a raise."},{"day":33,"min":649,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":33,"min":777,"text":"One part worth keeping from the free pile. 2 in the van."},{"day":33,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":34,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":34,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":34,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":34,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$76."},{"day":34,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":34,"min":946,"text":"2 parts worth keeping from the free pile. 4 in the van."},{"day":34,"min":1066,"text":"A platform under the mattress, from pallet wood and stubbornness. You sleep off the cold floor."},{"day":35,"min":440,"text":"Sage’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":35,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":35,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":35,"min":648,"text":"Three hours of oat milk. +$38."},{"day":35,"min":648,"text":"A walk-in: paid, and that’s all. Signed-up shifts are the ones that count toward a raise."},{"day":35,"min":648,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":35,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":36,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes 